>> title: Honey Cake
>> category: Cakes & Loaves
>> tags: honey, spice, coffee, oven
>> servings: 12
>> time: 1 hr 30 min

Grease a #9-in tube pan{}.

Preheat the #oven{} to 325°F (165°C).

Whisk @honey{1%cup}(340 g), @strong brewed coffee{1/2%cup}(120 mL; hot), @orange juice{1/4%cup}(60 mL).

Whisk @eggs{3%large}, @granulated sugar{3/4%cup}(150 g), @vegetable oil{1/2%cup}(120 mL).

Whisk @all-purpose flour{2 1/2%cup}(315 g), @baking powder{1 1/2%tsp}(6 g), @baking soda{1%tsp}(6 g), @ground cinnamon{1 1/2%tsp}(4 g), @ground cloves{1/2%tsp}(1 g), @table salt{1/2%tsp}(3 g).

Fold @&(~1)spiced flour{}, @&(3)honey mixture{} into @&(4)egg mixture{}.

Bake @&(~1)batter{} at 325°F for ~{60%min}.
